title: Start
---
<<declare $clue = false>>
<<declare $trust = 0>>
Mara: A ticket is missing. #line:opening
-> Inspect the envelope. #line:inspect
    <<set $clue = true>>
    <<set $trust += 1>>
    <<portrait iris>>
    Iris: You noticed the seal. #line:seal
-> Leave it alone. #line:leave
    Elias: Some journeys should stay private. #line:private
<<if $clue and $trust > 0>>
    <<detour Clue>>
<<else>>
    Mara: We arrive without an answer. #line:unresolved
<<endif>>
<<jump Finish>>
===
title: Clue
---
Iris: Trust: {$trust}. #line:trust
<<return>>
===
title: Finish
---
-> Reveal the clue. <<if $clue>> #line:reveal
    <<ending truth>>
-> Keep the secret. #line:secret
    <<ending secret>>
<<stop>>
===
